# Guitar (issue 047): hung by its headstock from a wooden hanger on the west wall. Seen from the room side with the headstock hooked on the hanger at the wall, the neck dropping straight down, and the lit face, cutaway on the right shoulder and the shaded side toward the wall showing on the body. 1x2 tiles. The floor plan still blocks both tiles.
size: 16x32
